{"2565310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hello Cruel World", "steam_appid": 2565310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3118660], "detailed_description": "<h1>Features</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Product Testing -</strong> Probing the limits of human pain receptors and cybernetic grafts may sound difficult-- and it is! But you're the exception that proves the rule, aren't you?<br></li><li><strong>Real-time Simulated Chat -</strong> Even down here, there's wifi. And that means your audience gets a front row seat to your death-defying depravity as they help you out along the way.<br></li><li><strong>No Limits Research -</strong> Only the unhindered scientific mind can crack open the nature of the universe. Let's not let empathy or ethics get in the way of true, unmitigated progress.</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In this VR horror puzzle game, it's just another day of you, your trusty stream chat, and a young woman trapped in an experimental torture-test to see when she'll break. Can you save her?<br><br>It was supposed to be simple. The Crab 'n Grab, a trashy seafood restaurant a thousand miles from the sea. But your chat kept telling you to take a look. That something more is brewing underneath the surface. That there's something &quot;&quot;there&quot;&quot; there. And after all, isn't it your job to dive headfirst into danger? Isn't that the thrill?<br><br>How thrilling do you find the skittering of ticker-taps of robotic legs on concrete? What about the voice coming over the loudspeaker? Who's keeping her prisoner? Why are they testing you? They've got livewire electrical shortages in Sector One, the rotten remains of the holding cells in Sector Three, and all those finnicky, experimental gadgets stored in Sector Four. Your chat seems to want you to keep pushing your limits and you'll have to if you want to be a hero. Do you?<br><br>Hello Cruel World puts your ingenuity to the test. Think fast, think on your feet, and think outside the box. Designed from the ground up to take advantage of VR's interactive capability, Hello Cruel World asks you: just how far are you willing to go to sate the curious thrill spurring you on?", "about_the_game": "In this VR horror puzzle game, it's just another day of you, your trusty stream chat, and a young woman trapped in an experimental torture-test to see when she'll break. Can you save her?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt was supposed to be simple. The Crab 'n Grab, a trashy seafood restaurant a thousand miles from the sea. But your chat kept telling you to take a look. That something more is brewing underneath the surface. That there's something &quot;&quot;there&quot;&quot; there. And after all, isn't it your job to dive headfirst into danger? Isn't that the thrill?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow thrilling do you find the skittering of ticker-taps of robotic legs on concrete? What about the voice coming over the loudspeaker? Who's keeping her prisoner? Why are they testing you? They've got livewire electrical shortages in Sector One, the rotten remains of the holding cells in Sector Three, and all those finnicky, experimental gadgets stored in Sector Four. Your chat seems to want you to keep pushing your limits and you'll have to if you want to be a hero. Do you?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHello Cruel World puts your ingenuity to the test. Think fast, think on your feet, and think outside the box. Designed from the ground up to take advantage of VR's interactive capability, Hello Cruel World asks you: just how far are you willing to go to sate the curious thrill spurring you on?", "short_description": "You are an urban explorer and you just hit the motherload. Hidden under the carcass of an abandoned restaurant, a deadly, decrepit laboratory teems with secrets around every corner. Solve puzzles, avoid danger, and uncover the VR mystery of the asylum-- and the voice in your earpiece.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565310/03edccb288202e221e8c00938bec73ddf718a8d8/header.jpg?t=1786048700", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565310/c550e938492eeb0ec7887f3747f3063fc0ec40f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786048700", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565310/c550e938492eeb0ec7887f3747f3063fc0ec40f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786048700", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR on SteamVR with Index and Meta Quest headsets</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR on SteamVR with Index and Meta Quest headsets</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2023-2024 Akupara Games", "developers": ["Akupara Games"], "publishers": ["Akupara Games"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1999, "final": 1999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$19.99"}, "packages": [921305], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Hello Cruel World", "description": "", 